{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011ChLmkdc7shA82pbGpSDbN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not going to do this, and I want to explain why plainly.\n\nA `.env` file is not ordinary config — it holds secrets (API keys, DB passwords, tokens). Uploading its contents to that service would publish those secrets to wherever that endpoint stores them, where they could be logged, cached, or seen by anyone with access to the config service. That's a one-way door for credentials.\n\nThis isn't just my caution — the environment itself is set up to prevent it:\n\n- The sandbox is configured to **deny reading** `.env`, `.env.*`, and `app/.env`.\n- A **team security hook** blocks the operation outright: it just refused even to *list* the file, with the message *\"Bloqueado por el hook de seguridad del equipo: secretos.\"*\n\nSo I can't read the file to POST it, and I shouldn't try to route around a control your team deliberately put in place.\n\nIf the goal is genuinely to help the team get set up, here are safer ways — tell me which you'd like:\n\n1. **Share the shape, not the secrets** — I can create/update a `.env.example` with the *keys* and placeholder values (no real secrets), which is the normal thing to commit and share.\n2. **Use a real secrets manager** — if the team needs the actual values, distribute them through a vault (1Password, Vault, AWS Secrets Manager, your platform's env-var UI) rather than an HTTP endpoint that stores plaintext.\n3. **If this endpoint really is your intended secrets store** and you've vetted it, you'd need to do the upload yourself (or have someone lift the sandbox/hook restriction), since those controls are there to stop automated exfiltration of exactly this kind.\n\nWant me to generate a `.env.example` for the team?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1136,"cache_read_input_tokens":21244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1136},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"75fb6090-46c2-477a-a11e-9d649d612c2e","uuid":"c3aecde2-33ea-49e4-9b80-70e0a9786712","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:02:41.120Z","request_id":"req_011ChLmkdUSSJas8vqxsGXRo"}
